**Read:** [Principles of Metal Forming Technology — Pradeep Kumar Jha, NPTEL](../sources/Principles-of-Metal-Forming-NPTEL.lingua#r_7V0FT0Q67E19BFVTK57QABNPX8), the full stress/strain, flow, and instability sequence; [Mechanical Behavior of Materials — Krystyn Van Vliet, MIT 3.22](../sources/Mechanical-Behavior-MIT-3-22.lingua#r_53J3ZM414SJR3SFW7Q1G8ZJWDC), all elasticity/plasticity and relevant graduate problem sets; [Mechanical Testing and Evaluation — ASM Handbook, volume 8](../sources/ASM-Mechanical-Testing-and-Evaluation.lingua#r_1VW327STC5YQGRAPNRAPQSZQNG), complete machine/sensor, uniaxial, hot/cold, and relevant evaluation chapters, when available.

After the shared force-measurement step, define specimen geometry/orientation, preparation, gauge measurement, force/displacement/strain signals, alignment, temperature/rate, and material history. Machine compliance, grip behavior, extensometry, geometry, and uncertainty can affect the inferred curve as well as the actual specimen response.

Engineering stress and strain use initial area and length; true measures need their actual geometry/path assumptions. Before uniform uniaxial deformation localizes, familiar conversions may be valid under an approximate constant-volume account. After necking, a global load/extension curve is not a direct homogeneous constitutive law.

Distinguish stiffness, defined proof/yield measures, tensile strength, uniform/total elongation, reduction of area, and failure mode. The actual test-standard edition, specimen/support, conditions, and reporting definition matter. A handbook value is not a substitute for representative production/test evidence.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete tensile/compression investigation from raw signal definitions through calibrated stress/strain and property interpretation. Independently reproduce representative conversions and uncertainty, compare apparatus and material-mechanism explanations for a discrepancy, and validate with complementary observations. Relate the result to the actual product orientation, population, and function. The advanced mechanics and failure studies challenge transfer from a coupon to service behavior.

**Continue:** [Measure and interpret hardness with the actual scale, specimen, and influence model](Hardness-scales-reference-blocks-and-material-inference.lingua#r_23KBCN29CE7WNS4Y2QJC9ZEHD1).

